  {
    "name": "estimate_room_materials",
    "title": "Estimate flooring, paint and baseboard",
    "description": "Use this when the user asks how much flooring, paint or baseboard a room needs for a remodel, renovation or refresh. Calculates quantities from the room's size and openings, with waste allowances, and the cost if unit prices are given. Returns floor area, paint gallons (exact and to buy), baseboard length and the assumptions used. Prices are in the user's own currency; flooring is priced per square foot, baseboard per foot and paint per gallon. Do not use for contractor quotes, labour costs, tile pattern layouts, or ordering materials.",
